  reduced dimensions are retained with length 1.

  If `axis` is None, all dimensions are reduced, and a
  tensor with a single element is returned.

  For example:

  >>> a = tf.constant([
  ...   [[1, 2], [3, 4]],
  ...   [[1, 2], [3, 4]]
  ... ])
